<item><title>26/88 Priors Road - Water Booster Pump Station - Design &amp; Build</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> 1.	Preparation of a detailed design for the booster pump station building, pump set, pipework, fittings, equipment and instrumentation, electrical and control, site services, site access, parking, landscaping, fencing, civil works and all associated works including (but not limited to) Drawings, Design Report, Functional Description, HAZOP, provision of PS1 and PS2 design certificates<br /><br />2.	Preparation and submission of building consent or building consent exemption<br /><br />3.	Engage WDC’s nominated electrical contractor (Nairn Electrical) to design, supply, install, test and commission the electrical and control system<br /><br />4.	Construction of the prepared design, including but not limited to:<br /><br />•	All necessary earthworks.<br /><br />•	Pump station building, including pump room and electrical and control room<br /><br />•	Pumps, pump manifold pipework, fittings, and equipment, pressure cylinder <br /><br />•	Inlet and outlet pipework, fittings and equipment<br /><br />•	Flow meter, p...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Dec/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2732<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 2]]></description>
