<item><title>Bridge Maintenance - Scour Remediation 2026 / 2027</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> 17x bridge structures throughout the district that require scour protection primarily in the form of riprap boulders to infill scour holes at culvert aprons, reinstate scoured embankments, and create passive support for exposed abutments as well as some concrete underpinning and gabion basket repairs.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 16/Dec/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2731<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
