<item><title>Rangiora Sewer Upgrade Stage 9</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> The main tasks involved in this Contract are:<br /><br />- Installation of 350m of DN225 PVC at depths ranging between 2-2.7m, within the<br /><br />road reserve.<br /><br />- Installation of 220m of DN150 PVC at depths ranging between 2-2.5m, within the<br /><br />road reserve.<br /><br />- Installation of 370m of DN100 laterals from new main to 1.4m below property<br /><br />boundary, within the road reserve<br /><br />- Installation of 12 No. of DN1050 manhole, ranging in depth from 2-2.6m with the<br /><br />road reserve<br /><br />- Road, footpath and berm reinstatement of trenches.<br /><br />- Testing and Commissioning of the works, including any remedial works required..<br /><br />- Complete As-built documentation to the Council’s requirements.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Dec/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2727<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=d77d6ab8cc0549bf8e10a6cbc71a0743s2727</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">d77d6ab8cc0549bf8e10a6cbc71a0743</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 23:56:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
