</item>
<item><title>26/82 Christmas Road Bridge Abutment Replacement</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> To replace the deteriorated timber southern abutment wall on the Christmas Road Bridge structure in Clarkville, Waimakariri.<br /><br />- Establish dewatering/flow diversion<br /><br />- Excavate and remove the existing timber abutment structure<br /><br />- Supply and install a new precast concrete abutment panel as per Engineering design drawings<br /><br />- Supply and install supporting Gabion baskets to prevent scour adjacent to the new headwall<br /><br />- Backfill and reinstate impacted road adjacent to bridge.<br /><br />- Supply and install new running planks on the timber deck of the bridge.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 09/Dec/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2726<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 8]]></description>
