<item><title>Canterbury Street Reserve Play Space Upgrade</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This project involves the upgrade of the Canterbury Street Reserve play space, in Ashley village, Waimakariri District. Work includes site establishment, earthworks, drainage, new pathways and hardstand areas, rubber and bark safety surfacing, landscaping, furniture installation, and the relocation or replacement of existing park assets. The works will deliver a renewed recreational space featuring a new playground, basketball half court, nature play elements, seating, picnic facilities, drainage improvements, and associated landscape enhancements.<br /><br />The expected works period is 6 weeks but the contractor may specify.<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Dec/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2724<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Building Trade, Repairs, Maint., Construction & Operation, Sport, Recreation Equip, Services<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 6]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=cbc5c861b07a4b19a000546f07d9b6cas2724</link>
