</item>
<item><title>WWTP Wetland Replanting Improvements 2026/27 - Civil Works</title>
<description><![CDATA[<b>Tender Details : </b> This Tender is for an earthworks contract associated with the refurbishment of three wastewater constructed wetlands across two Waimakariri District Council Wastewater Treatment Plants.<br /><br />Anticipated work at each wastewater treatment plant:<br /><br />Woodend Wastewater Treatment Plant (Gladstone Road Woodend):<br /><br />- Isolation and dewatering of two existing constructed wetlands.<br /><br />- Mechanical de-sludging of accumulated wastewater sludge.<br /><br />- Construction of new planting areas (5000m2 total) using site-won material.<br /><br />- Construction of final planting layer with imported screened topsoil.<br /><br />- Widening, repair and reconstruction of wetland bunds and rip-rap basin liner.<br /><br />Kaiapoi Wastewater Treatment Plant (Beach Road Kaiapoi):<br /><br />- Isolation and dewatering of one existing constructed wetland.<br /><br />- Renewal and replacement of four precast culvert headwalls<br /><br />- Construction of temporary haul road within the site extents.<br /><b...<br /><br /><b>Issued by : </b> Waimakariri District Council<br /><b>Closing Date</b> : 02/Dec/2026 04:00 pm (UTC+12:00) Auckland, Wellington time<br /><b>Reference number</b> : VP2720<br /><b>Contact person</b> : Not disclosed<br /><b>Tender categories</b> : Construction & Operation, Water & Sewage<br /><b>Specification Docs</b> : 15]]></description>
<link>https://www.vendorpanel.nz/PublicTenderAccess.aspx?id=6e38899a1e4f45db98db2ce9978e7e2cs2720</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">6e38899a1e4f45db98db2ce9978e7e2c</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 05:34:00 GMT</pubDate>
<category>Construction &amp; Operation</category>
